        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overkill Squad is a ultra high-speed top-down shooter roguelike built around intense 1-minute combat arenas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your fighter, unleash overwhelming firepower, defeat brutal bosses, and collect relics to dominate every run.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your fighter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/559f0d2f202e991344d25dde7fddc06d.poster.avif?t=1772993408\" width=1170 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/559f0d2f202e991344d25dde7fddc06d.webm?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/559f0d2f202e991344d25dde7fddc06d.mp4?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters, each with their own special power and melee attack</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill everything that moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/912a54f4971c049fb457e62f5dbb40ae.poster.avif?t=1772993408\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/912a54f4971c049fb457e62f5dbb40ae.webm?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/912a54f4971c049fb457e62f5dbb40ae.mp4?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fastest-paced bullet hell combat — enemies flood the screen and you survive by pure reflex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every level lasts about 1 minute</strong>, so the action never slows down.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use massive arsenal of weapons to clear levels ranging from Wastelands to Space Ships</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight epic bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/26834850948f00c5f3f176a3d25f9669.poster.avif?t=1772993408\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/26834850948f00c5f3f176a3d25f9669.webm?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/26834850948f00c5f3f176a3d25f9669.mp4?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal boss battles that push your skills to the limit</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create unique relic combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/dddd02271bf91bcbec45f5ecda71f911.poster.avif?t=1772993408\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/dddd02271bf91bcbec45f5ecda71f911.webm?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/extras/dddd02271bf91bcbec45f5ecda71f911.mp4?t=1772993408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique relics for endless build combinations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no lore, no story, no unsolved mysteries — just violence and chaos. Join the Overkill Squad and get ready for total destruction.</p>",
